Description:
Stun and delight your partner in this sexy mini dress! With a flattering scoop neck the fitted leotard style top gives way to an open weave, thigh skimming bottom skirt which is finished off with a lace trim. Made from stretchy, comfortable nylon material to fit and flatter your figure, ideal for special couple’s nights or any other seductive occasion.

A dress to impress, this Moonlight mini will delight your customers so let them shine!

&nbsp;

Do you want to play? This Sex Play card game by Secret Play lets you get to know your partner through questions, seduction and erotic fantasies. Discover sex in a different way, forget taboos and enjoy this exciting game. Will you be able to get to the end of the game!

Contains 55 cards.

